          "type": "U",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "This spell inscribes a spell on a specially prepared piece of paper. The rune can then be used to cast the inscribed spell once. The spell to be inscribed must be cast within one minute after the Rune spell is cast. Rune I can only inscribe 1st level spells. The rune can be set to affect the reader. The attack level of a rune is the level of the spell put into it."
        }
