          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "[RR Mod: -20] A Sign can be inscribed on any \"non-mobile\" surface and affects the triggering being. A Sign can be triggered by: a) specified time has passed, b) specified movements within 20', c) specified sounds within 20', d) touch, or e) reading. The Sign is cancelled when a being fails a RR against it. Sign of Shock puts the target in a state of shock for 10 minutes per 10 failure (treat as if target is stunned, except target will never pass out due to this shock)."
